    "name": "H1 News API",
    "description": "Real-time, ticker-tagged, sentiment-scored financial news from 135+ sources. Set the `api_key` collection variable (get one at https://heliusone.com/newsapi). Full reference: https://api.heliusone.com/docs. The WebSocket stream (wss://api.heliusone.com/v1/stream?api_key=\u2026) is not a REST request \u2014 use Postman's WebSocket client, or mint a token with the Stream folder for a browser.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
